{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ואברכה מברכיך</b> — in gematria: the priests who bless your children. Therefore מברכיך is plural and מקללך is singular." "<b>ומקללך אאור</b> — in gematria: this is Balaam who comes to curse your children." "<b>ואברכה</b> — twice in the Masorah: here and the other ואברכה שמך לעולם. For He blessed a blessing that has no interruption, and this is ואברכה שמך לעולם."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:59.146493133Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}